.DS_Store

# OpenDream-specific runtime artefacts that should never be committed.
# (Inline comments after a pattern do NOT work in .gitignore — git treats
#  the trailing text as part of the pattern, breaking the rule silently.)

# The pipeline's OUTPUT in any project that runs OpenDream:
AGENTS.md
# Per-trial workspaces produced by `opendream eval run`:
.opendream-eval/
# Local prompt-tuning dry-run scratchpad:
/tmp/od_dryrun/
# Eval run logs:
eval_logs/
